      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_dbaf78ef6cbb65aadd004b2015c1749d53867111349df363737e52e1d3bfd4db"
      ],
      "text": "The documented pipeline comprises six stages: Retriever (few-shot retrieval), Planner (structured visual descriptions), Stylist, Visualizer (image or Matplotlib code), Critic (multi-round review), and optional Polish."
    },
