        "slc_9ba665a3e2cb576870e84fa62a0b0e8e3a6e73c43b82ceeb509aaf0e56492b50"
      ],
      "text": "The README describes a registry-driven pipeline (Pipeline Registry) intended to replace hardcoded branching so new flows can be added via configuration."
    },
